@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@roomId = 1
@aiRoomId = replace-with-ai-room-id-from-log-or-db
@imageUrl1 = https://example.com/room-1.jpg
@imageUrl2 = https://example.com/room-2.jpg

### 1. 방 메타데이터 생성
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/rooms
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "propertyId": 1,
  "ownerId": 1,
  "roomName": "테스트 방",
  "pricePerNight": 100000,
  "maxGuests": 2
}

### 2. 여러 이미지 분석 시작
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/rooms/{{roomId}}/models/analyze
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "imageUrls": [
    "{{imageUrl1}}",
    "{{imageUrl2}}"
  ]
}

### 3. 상태 조회: ANALYZING 예상
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/rooms/{{roomId}}/models/status
Accept: application/json

### AI 1차 분석 완료 Webhook 수동 테스트
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/webhook
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "aiRoomId": "{{aiRoomId}}",
  "status": "WAITING_FOR_CORRECTION",
  "roomDataJson": "{\"vertices\":[{\"id\":\"vertex-1\",\"x\":10.0,\"y\":20.0,\"z\":0.0,\"imageIndex\":0}],\"edges\":[]}",
  "modelUrl": null,
  "fileSizeMb": null,
  "format": null
}

### 4. 상태 조회: WAITING_FOR_CORRECTION 및 roomData JSON 객체 예상
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/rooms/{{roomId}}/models/status
Accept: application/json

### 5. 보정 데이터 전송 후 재구성 시작
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/rooms/{{roomId}}/models/reconstruct
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "vertices": [
    {
      "id": "vertex-1",
      "x": 12.0,
      "y": 21.0,
      "z": 0.0,
      "imageIndex": 0
    }
  ],
  "edges": []
}

### 6. 상태 조회: RECONSTRUCTING 예상
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/rooms/{{roomId}}/models/status
Accept: application/json

### AI 최종 재구성 완료 Webhook 수동 테스트
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/webhook
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "aiRoomId": "{{aiRoomId}}",
  "status": "SUCCESS",
  "roomDataJson": "{\"vertices\":[{\"id\":\"vertex-1\",\"x\":12.0,\"y\":21.0,\"z\":3.0,\"imageIndex\":0}],\"edges\":[]}",
  "modelUrl": "https://example.com/models/test-room.glb",
  "fileSizeMb": 12.34,
  "format": "glb"
}

### 7. 상태 조회: SUCCESS, modelUrl, roomData 객체 예상
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/rooms/{{roomId}}/models/status
Accept: application/json
